	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Me dei benignitate salvum et incolumen domum ex <placeName ref="l21">Termis</placeName> repedasse, statim a reditu <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>meo literis tibi significavi, quibus alię erant inclusę ad <persName ref="p8498">Marcellum Theodo[ricum</persName>] dandę, <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>quas te accepisse spero.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Res apud nos sunt in pristino utpote flebili statu, <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>quem nemo nisi vel divinitus adiutus vel omnino impius pacienter feret.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z5"/>Quid in <placeName ref="l830">Anglia</placeName> nuper accidit, haud dubie nosti.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Legatus, qui prętextu nuptiarum <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>conficiendarum istic fuit, tantum potuit apud regis auxiliarios, ut illi <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>in excidium evangelii conspirarint.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Quod ubi protector regni et regis animad<lb xml:id="p1z8"/>vertit, cum rege in arcem quandam confugit.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Consiliarii autem rumorem divulgarunt <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>protectorem ipsum regem captivum tenere, quapropter liberacione ipsius opus <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>esse.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Hinc magnus numerus armatorum confluxit, atque arx, in quam se protector cum <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>rege contulerat, obsessa est, licet occupandi illius nullam spem habuerint proditores <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>veritatis.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Verum cum regis custodia et satrapis tantum egerunt, ut regem <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>et protectorem in manus eorum dederint.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Quę inde rerum mutatio secutura <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>sit, facile est iudicatu.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Ve <persName ref="p2336">Bernhardino</persName>, veh <persName ref="p8111">Petro Martiri</persName>, <persName ref="p467">Butzero</persName> et aliis <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>bonis.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z16"/>Rogo te, ut <placeName ref="l28">Basileam</placeName> scribas, an istic venundentur volumina iuris civilis <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>Corpus iuris appellata, nimirum ea, quę paucos ante annos et proxime quidem <placeName ref="l378">Parr<lb xml:id="p1z18"/>ysiis</placeName> sunt impressa, et quanti emantur.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Opus mihi erit equidem illis ad querendum <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>victum, quanquam nihildum die benignitate mihi et meis hactenus decesserit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z20"/>Has literas cum Psalterio mihi <placeName ref="l822">Germanice</placeName> reddito ad <persName ref="p8498">Marcellum Theodoricum</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>missurus es, tanquam donariolum ei promissum; sensi equidem virum illum <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>singulari dilectione erga me duci quemadmodum ego non minus vicissim <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>me debee illi fateor; sit igitur is et tibi optime commendatus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p1z24"/>Domino <persName ref="p8011">Gualtero</persName>, <persName ref="p1283">Gesnero</persName>, <persName ref="p8171">Bibliandro</persName>, <persName ref="p1214">Frisio</persName>, <persName ref="p3988">Guolfio</persName>, <persName ref="p7228">Zvinglio</persName>, <persName ref="p8127">Pellica[no]</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>item et questori exulanti, tum etiam magistris civium, prothoscribę atq<lb xml:id="p1z26"/>ue singulis, <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>quibus convenit, ex me salutem dicito et excusa meam nuperam abitionem <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>clanculariam<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Dazu a. R. ... anquam recentem ... vide ne ab [saluta]tione mea excludas.</note>.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale, mi vir, et pro me meisque ad dominum ora.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">29. octobris 1549.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z29"/>Tuus ex animo <persName ref="p8354">G[eorgius] <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>L[aetus</persName>].</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse:]</note>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="de">Dem hochgelerten, fromen herren <persName ref="p495">Henrichen <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Bullinger</persName>, vorgeer<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">Antistes.</note> der christenlichen gemaind <lb xml:id="p2z3"/><placeName ref="l587">Zürch</placeName>, mynem geliebten frunnde, zuzestellen<lb xml:id="p2z4"/>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
